flowchart LR
  subgraph PRE[Customer lifecycle · Zapier]
    optin[Opt-in event] --> welcome[Welcome email]
    cart[Abandoned cart] --> wait[Delay + eligibility re-check]
    wait --> recovery[Recovery email]
    dormant[No order for 60 days] --> winback[Win-back email]
  end
  subgraph POST[Store events · Make]
    shopify[Shopify order / fulfillment / return] --> router[Router by event type]
  end
  subgraph SHARED[Shared message service · Node.js]
    api[Authenticated webhook API] --> compose[Validate + compose message]
    policy[Store policy JSON] --> support[Classify + draft support reply]
    llm[Optional OpenAI API] -. wording only .-> support
  end
  welcome --> api
  recovery --> api
  winback --> api
  router --> api
  compose --> provider[Verified email provider]
  inbox[Gmail support inbox] --> n8n[n8n trigger + normalize]
  n8n --> support
  support --> draft[Gmail thread draft]
  draft --> human[Person reviews and sends]
